      "formula": "CCF = (EAD - E(t_r)) / (L(t_r) - E(t_r))",
      "us_terms": {
        "en": "The same ratio is the loan equivalent (LEQ) in US terms; Qi (2009) calls EAD over outstanding the CCF and EAD over the limit the EADF.",
        "es": "La misma razon es el equivalente de credito (LEQ) en terminos de EE.UU.; Qi (2009) llama CCF a EAD sobre el saldo y EADF a EAD sobre el limite."
      }
